38
00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:34.820
Racks are designed to allow for good
airflow and front and rear

39
00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:38.480
access to all components. This makes

40
00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:42.520
maintenance easier and supports good cable
management. Neatly

41
00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:46.480
routed cables not only look better, they
